### Peticiones de prueba — extensión "REST Client" de VS Code
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Registro de usuario
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Gerardo Olivares", "email": "gerardo@ejemplo.com", "password": "Tareas2026" }

### Inicio de sesión (guarda el token)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "gerardo@ejemplo.com", "password": "Tareas2026" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### GET /tareas sin token -> 401
GET {{base}}/tareas

### GET /tareas con token
GET {{base}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST /tareas
# @name nueva
POST {{base}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "titulo": "Entregar la Actividad 3", "descripcion": "Subir server.js, tareas.json, el Word y el video." }

###
@id = {{nueva.response.body.tarea.id}}

### PUT /tareas/:id
PUT {{base}}/tareas/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "completada": true }

### DELETE /tareas/:id
DELETE {{base}}/tareas/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST inválido -> 400
POST {{base}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "descripcion": "Falta el título" }
